# Pull Request Description

## Summary

This pull request introduces enhancements to the Google generative AI language model provider within the Vercel AI project. The updates focus on refining the token usage count and improving the associated tests to ensure accurate usage tracking.

Sample output of google api show below ⬇️, each chunk contain `usageMetadata` info:

```bash
➜  ~ curl "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-1.5-flash-latest:streamGenerateContent?alt=sse&key=${GOOGLE_API_KEY}" \
        -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
        --no-buffer \
        -d '{ "contents":[{"parts":[{"text": "Hi! Who are you?"}]}]}' \
        2> /dev/null

