Also, this PR adds a new `AIProvider` generic helper so circular type references can be implemented correctly:

```ts
const AI = createAI({
  initialAIState: 'hi',
  actions: {
    foo: async () => {
      const aiState = getAIState<typeof AI>();
      return aiState;
